DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE

No quote or risk data is contained in this repository, and the .gitignore is
written to keep it that way. Any data you collect or licence is governed by its
own terms, which are typically more restrictive than this file:

  - Vendor extracts (Consumer Intelligence, Defaqto and similar) arrive under a
    licence that usually restricts redistribution and derived works. Read it
    before publishing anything built from one, including accuracy tables broken
    down by brand.

  - Quotes collected from comparison sites are subject to those sites' terms of
    use, and the results pages may attract UK database right independently of
    any individual price.

  - Any personal data collected from someone other than yourself is subject to
    UK GDPR and needs a lawful basis.

None of the above is legal advice. Take proper counsel before any commercial
use of this work or of data gathered with it.
